repair = "Name gateway.endpoint as the settlement authority shared with readiness and evm.endpoint as the watcher/relay URL, update example substitutions, and explicitly support distinct URLs on the same chain. A real PaymentGate and HTTP server use distinct loopback peers; only the settlement peer serves receipt lookup, and method/chain failures close paid-route eligibility."
